Tock's Wind-Up Workshop trailer: third-party assets

Characters, story and game: Tock's Wind-Up Workshop, the user's own original game.

Samples (CC0 1.0): Versilian Community Sample Library (VCSL), Versilian Studios / Sam Gossner,
  https://github.com/sgossner/VCSL (glockenspiel, xylophone, marimba, vibraphone, harp, tenor sax,
  woodblock, claps, bass drum, cymbals)
Music box and plucked bass: synthesised with physical models (pluck.py), no samples.
Sound effects: synthesised in code (sfx.py and mix.py), no samples.

HDRI "photo_studio_loft_hall", "american_walnut_veneer" textures and the "desk_lamp_arm_01" model:
  Poly Haven (https://polyhaven.com), CC0 1.0.
Font: Fredoka, SIL Open Font License 1.1.
3D rendering: three.js (MIT).
